  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Dataset-Research",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\ti. Commiting using CLI:\n\t\n\n\nhf auth login\nhf upload UKM-RA-2026/Dataset-Research . . --repo-type dataset --commit-message \"your-text\"\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t1. Lip Movement\n\t\n\n\nAll Models under Lip Movement contain a file \"Dataset_Used.md\"\nThis file lists all the used data\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t2. Dataset\n\t\n\n\nSince most of the open source models uses similar publicly available data, it is all in one folder \nThis contains all the dataset listed in Lip Movement\nMost if not all datasets are not\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/UKM-RA-2026/Dataset-Research.",
